return ['x-generator'=>'GlotPress/4.0.3','translation-revision-date'=>'2025-10-28 08:01:43+0000','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','project-id-version'=>'Plugins - Simple CAPTCHA Alternative with Cloudflare Turnstile - Stable (latest release)','language'=>'zh_TW','messages'=>['Sponsor'=>'贊助者','Help fund ongoing development, maintenance, and support of this 100% free plugin, and be listed as a sponsor.'=>'資助這個完全免費的外掛持續開發、維護並提供技術支援，並能在 GitHub 上列為贊助者。','Sponsor:'=>'贊助者:','Consider making a small donation to the developer to help support the plugin.'=>'請考慮小額贊助支持開發者的外掛開發工作。','Review'=>'使用者評論','If you found this plugin useful, please submit a positive review on <a href="%s" target="_blank">WordPress.org</a>.'=>'如果這個外掛對網站有所幫助，請在 <a href="%s" target="_blank">WordPress.org</a> 上撰寫正面的使用者評論。','Leave a Review:'=>'撰寫評論:','Thanks to the donors and <a href="%s" target="_blank">sponsors</a> that help support my free plugins to keep them 100%% free, maintained and supported.'=>'感謝一般贊助者及 <a href="%s" target="_blank">GitHub 贊助者</a>協助這個免費外掛維持提供 100%% 免費、維護及技術支援。','Support The Plugin'=>'支持外掛開發工作','Help and Resources:'=>'線上說明及相關資源:','If the Turnstile widget is not showing, disable <a href="%s" target="_blank">Element Caching</a> for the Elementor form on your page, or try switching Integration Method.'=>'如果沒有顯示 Turnstile 小工具，代表必須為相關頁面的 Elementor 聯絡表單停用 <a href="%s" target="_blank">Element 快取</a>，或切換 [整合方法]。','Page IDs (comma-separated)'=>'頁面 ID (使用逗號分隔)','Loads scripts only on the page IDs you enter below. Leave the list empty to load nowhere.'=>'僅在符合下方輸入的頁面 ID 的頁面載入指令碼。留空代表不在任何位置載入指令碼。','Loads scripts only on pages that include an Elementor Form or Login widget. Popups or global templates may not be detected.'=>'僅在頁面包含 Elementor 聯絡表單或登入小工具時載入指令碼。可能無法偵測到彈出式訊息或全域範本。','Loads scripts on all Elementor pages. Use this if caching breaks the element-based method. May load scripts on pages without forms.'=>'在全部 Elementor 頁面載入指令碼。如果快取造成以元素為基礎的方法，請使用這項設定。這項設定可能會在沒有包含聯絡表單的頁面載入指令碼。','Enter specific page IDs'=>'輸入指定頁面 ID','Autodetect pages with forms'=>'自動偵測包含聯絡表單的頁面','All Elementor pages'=>'全部 Elementor Forms 頁面','Load scripts on:'=>'指令碼載入位置:','Instead of using this option, try disabling Element caching first.'=>'使用這項設定前，請先嘗試停用 Element 快取再做決定。','Scripts are loaded globally on all Elementor pages. This method works better with some caching but may load scripts on pages without forms.'=>'在全部 Elementor 頁面全域載入指令碼。這個方法會比一些使用快取的狀況下效果更好，但可能會在沒有表單的頁面載入指令碼。','(Recommended) Scripts are loaded when each form element is rendered. This is the ideal method but may not work with some caching. Have issues? Try disabling Element caching.'=>'(建議使用) 在轉譯全部元素時載入指令碼。這是最理想的方法，但卻可能在某些快取的狀況下無法運作。如果發生問題，請停用元素快取。','Load Scripts Globally'=>'全域載入指令碼','Load Scripts Via Element'=>'透過元素載入指令碼','Integration Method'=>'整合方法','Adds better compatibility with popular performance/optimization plugins (e.g. WP Rocket, LiteSpeed Cache, Autoptimize, Perfmatters, SG Optimizer) to prevent their JS optimizations from breaking Turnstile. Disable only if this causes issues.'=>'為使用常用的效能/最佳化外掛 (例如 WP Rocket、LiteSpeed Cache、Autoptimize、Perfmatters、SG Optimizer 等) 的網站帶來更加的相容性，以避免這類外掛的 JS 最佳化造成 Turnstile 停擺。僅有在這個功能造成問題才需要停用。','Performance Plugin Compatibility'=>'效能外掛相容性','Performance'=>'效能','Custom Messages'=>'自訂訊息','Widget Customization'=>'自訂小工具','Link by Stripe'=>'Link by Stripe','Google Pay'=>'Google Pay','Apple Pay'=>'Apple Pay','WooPayments Express'=>'WooPayments Express','Note: Currently Turnstile is not able to perform spam checks for some "Express Checkout" payment methods (e.g. PayPal, Google Pay, Apple Pay, Amazon Pay) and will skip them automatically.'=>'注意事項: Turnstile 目前無法對某些具備快速結帳功能的付款方法 (例如 PayPal、Google Pay、Apple Pay、Amazon Pay 等) 進行垃圾訊息檢查，並會自動略過這些付款方法。','Import failed: File is not a Simple Cloudflare Turnstile export.'=>'匯入失敗: 檔案不是由 Simple Cloudflare Turnstile 所匯出。','Import failed: File too large.'=>'匯入失敗: 檔案大小超過上限。','Import failed: File type must be .json.'=>'匯入失敗: 檔案類型必須是 .json。','Import failed: Invalid JSON file.'=>'匯入失敗: 無效的 JSON 檔案。','Import failed: File was empty.'=>'匯入失敗: 檔案內容為空。','Import failed: Upload error.'=>'匯入失敗: 上傳檔案時發生錯誤。','Import failed: No file uploaded.'=>'匯入失敗: 沒有上傳任何檔案。','Import failed.'=>'匯入失敗。','Settings imported successfully. %d option(s) updated.'=>'設定已成功匯入。%d 個選項已更新。','You do not have permission to import settings.'=>'目前的登入身分沒有匯入設定的權限。','You do not have permission to export settings.'=>'目前的登入身分沒有匯出設定的權限。','Note: Site/Secret keys defined in wp-config.php will not be overwritten by import.'=>'注意事項: 匯入設定時不會覆寫在 wp-config.php 檔案中定義的網站金鑰/秘密金鑰。','Import JSON'=>'匯入 JSON 檔案','Import Settings'=>'匯入設定','Download JSON'=>'下載 JSON 檔案','Include API keys (sensitive)'=>'包含 API 金鑰 (敏感性資訊)','Export Settings'=>'匯出設定','Export all plugin settings to a JSON file, or import from a JSON file exported from this plugin.'=>'將外掛的全部設定匯出為 JSON 檔案，或匯入這個外掛匯出的 JSON 檔案。','Export / Import Settings'=>'匯出/匯入設定','Warning: This is not required. Only do this if you are comfortable editing wp-config.php. If you define the keys here, they will override the settings above.'=>'警告: 這不是必要設定，且僅有在具備編輯 wp-config.php 的權限時才能進行這項設定。如果將金鑰定義於 wp-config.php 中，就會覆寫上方的設定。','To do this, add the following lines to your wp-config.php file before the line that says "/* That\'s all, stop editing! Happy publishing. */":'=>'如需進行這項設定，請在這個網站的 wp-config.php 中將以下常數新增於「/* That\'s all, stop editing! Happy publishing. */」之前。','You can optionally define your API keys in your wp-config.php file so the keys are not stored in the database.'=>'網站管理員可以選擇性在 wp-config.php 檔案中定義專屬 API 金鑰，金鑰便不會儲存在網站資料庫中。','Optional: Define keys in wp-config.php'=>'選用: 在 wp-config.php 中定義金鑰','Using keys defined in wp-config.php. Be sure to test your forms to confirm they are working.'=>'目前使用定義於 wp-config.php 中的金鑰。請務必測試這個網站的表單，以確認金鑰能否正確運作。','Simple CAPTCHA Alternative with Cloudflare Turnstile'=>'Simple CAPTCHA Alternative with Cloudflare Turnstile','Turnstile is supported for WP User Manager Login, Registration and Reset Pa