4WP: Mailchimp for WordPress','After Form'=>'表單下方','When enabled, Turnstile will be added above the submit button, on ALL your forms created with Elementor Pro Forms.'=>'啟用這項設定後，Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能便會顯示於全部 Elementor Pro 聯絡表單的提交按鈕上方。','Enable on all Elementor Forms'=>'在全部 Elementor Forms 聯絡表單中啟用','Elementor Forms'=>'Elementor Forms 聯絡表單','Currently Ninja Forms is not supported by this plugin.'=>'這個外掛目前不支援 Ninja Forms。','Ninja Forms'=>'Ninja Forms','Click here for more information.'=>'點擊這裡以進一步了解','Currently WS Form is not supported by this plugin, however their plugin does have its own Turnstile addon.'=>'這個外掛目前不支援 WS Form，但是他們的外掛有專屬的 Turnstile 附加元件。','WS Form'=>'WS Form','Forminator'=>'Forminator','When enabled, Turnstile will be added above the submit button, on ALL your forms created with Forminator Forms.'=>'啟用這項設定後，Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能便會顯示於全部 Forminator Forms 聯絡表單的提交按鈕上方。','Enable on all Forminator Forms'=>'在全部 Forminator Forms 聯絡表單中啟用','Forminator Forms'=>'Forminator Forms','Formidable'=>'Formidable','When enabled, Turnstile will be added above the submit button, on ALL your forms created with Formidable Forms.'=>'啟用這項設定後，Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能便會顯示於全部 Formidable Forms 聯絡表單的提交按鈕上方。','Enable on all Formidable Forms'=>'在全部 Formidable Forms 聯絡表單中啟用','Formidable Forms'=>'Formidable Forms','When enabled, Turnstile will be added above the submit button, on ALL your forms created with Fluent Forms.'=>'啟用這項設定後，Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能便會顯示於全部 Fluent Forms 聯絡表單的提交按鈕上方。','Enable on all Fluent Forms'=>'在全部 Fluent Forms 聯絡表單中啟用','Fluent Forms'=>'Fluent Forms','When enabled, Turnstile will be added before/after the submit button, on ALL your forms created with Gravity Forms.'=>'啟用這項設定後，Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能便會顯示於全部 Gravity Forms 聯絡表單的提交按鈕前方/後方。','Enable on all Gravity Forms'=>'在全部 Gravity Forms 聯絡表單中啟用','Gravity Forms'=>'Gravity Forms','Separate each ID with a comma, for example: 5,10'=>'請以逗號分隔多個 ID。範例: 5,10','If you want to DISABLE the Turnstile widget on certain forms, enter the %s ID in this field.'=>'如果需要在指定功能表單停用 Cloudflare Turnstile 小工具，請在這個欄位輸入 %s 的表單 ID。','Disabled Form IDs'=>'停用表單 ID','After Button'=>'按鈕下方','Before Button'=>'按鈕上方','Note: WPForms has an option to configure Turnstile on its own Settings page "CAPTCHA" tab. You should only enable it in one place, either here -OR- in those settings.'=>'注意事項: WPForms 在其外掛設定頁面的 [CAPTCHA] 分頁，有可以為 Turnstile 進行組態的選項。相關設定僅能在同一處啟用，請在這裡啟用，或在 WPForms 設定中啟用。','When enabled, Turnstile will be added before/after the submit button, on ALL your forms created with WPForms.'=>'啟用這項設定後，Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能便會顯示於全部 WPForms 聯絡表單的提交按鈕前方/後方。','Enable on all WPForms'=>'在全部 WPForms 聯絡表單中啟用','WPForms'=>'WPForms','To add Turnstile to individual Contact Form 7 forms, simply add this shortcode to any of your forms (in the form editor):'=>'如需將 Cloudflare Turnstile 的人機驗證功能加入 Contact Form 7 的個別聯絡表單中，請使用表單編輯器將以下短代碼加入需要這個功能的聯絡表單。','Enable on all CF7 Forms'=>'在全部 Contact Form 7 聯絡表單中啟用','Contact Form 7'=>'Contact Form 7','Paid Memberships PRO'=>'Paid Memberships Pro','Currently Turnstile can not be implemented on the lost password form when PMP is installed.'=>'請注意，安裝 Paid Memberships Pro 後，便無法在忘記密碼表單使用 Turnstile 人機驗證。','Lost Password Form'=>'忘記密碼表單','Edit via "WordPress Login" option in the "Default WordPress Forms" settings.'=>'透過 [WordPress 預設功能表單] 中的 [WordPress 登入表單] 編輯','Login Form'=>'登入表單','Checkout / Registration'=>'結帳/註冊表單','Paid Memberships Pro'=>'Paid Memberships Pro','EDD Register'=>'Easy Digital Downloads 註冊表單','EDD Login'=>'Easy Digital Downloads 登入表單','EDD Checkout'=>'Easy Digital Downloads 結帳表單','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','If selected below, Turnstile check will not be run for that specific payment method.'=>'如果選取了所列項目，Turnstile 便不會在指定付款方法執行驗證。','Payment Methods to Skip'=>'要略過的付款方式','WooCommerce Pay for Order'=>'WooCommerce 前往付款','After Billing'=>'帳單下方','Before Billing'=>'帳單上方','Before Pay Button'=>'付款按鈕上方','After Payment'=>'付款之後','Before Payment'=>'付款之前','Widget Location'=>'小工具位置','Guest Checkout Only'=>'僅訪客結帳','WooCommerce Checkout'=>'WooCommerce 結帳表單','WooCommerce Reset Password'=>'WooCommerce 重設密碼表單','WooCommerce Register'=>'WooCommerce 註冊表單','WooCommerce Login'=>'WooCommerce 登入表單','WooCommerce Forms'=>'WooCommerce 功能表單','Compatible with wpDiscuz!'=>'與 wpDiscuz 相容！','Due to Jetpack limitations, this does NOT currently work with Jetpack comments form enabled.'=>'由於 Jetpack 的限制，這個功能無法在 Jetpack 留言表單中使用。','AJAX comments form?'=>'使用 AJAX 留言表單','Enable this if you are using an AJAX based comments form plugin or theme.'=>'如果這個網站使用包含 AJAX 留言表單功能的外掛或佈景主題，請啟用這個功能。','WordPress Comment'=>'WordPress 留言表單','WordPress Reset Password'=>'WordPress 重設密碼表單','Enable this option to only enable on default WordPress register form at wp-login.php?action=register'=>'啟用這項設定後，Turnstile 僅會在 WordPress 預設註冊表單 wp-login.php?action=register 上執行','WordPress Register'=>'WordPress 註冊表單','Only enable on default wp-login.php page'=>'僅於預設的 wp-login.php 頁面啟用','Enable this option to only enable on default WordPress login form at wp-login.php'=>'啟用這項設定後，Turnstile 僅會在 WordPress 預設登入表單 wp-login.php 上執行','WordPress Login'=>'WordPress 登入表單','Default WordPress Forms'=>'WordPress 預設功能表單','Select the dropdown for each integration, and choose when specific forms you want to enable Turnstile on.'=>'請開啟每一個整合項目的開闔式選單，並依據需求選取要啟用 Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能的功能表單。','Enable Turnstile on your forms:'=>'依需求啟用 Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證','One per line.  All visitors with listed User Agents will not see the Turnstile challenge. Warning: If an attacker knows one of the whitelisted User Agents, they might be able to spoof that User Agent to bypass Turnstile.'=>'每行一個使用者代理程式。透過允許的使用者代理程式存取網站的使用者，不會需要進行 Turnstile 驗證。請注意，如果惡意第三方知道這個網站允許的使用者代理程式，便可輕鬆避開 Turnstile 驗證。','User Agents'=>'使用者代理程式','One per line. Wildcards are not supported. All visitors with listed IP addresses will not see the Turnstile challenge. Warning: If an attacker knows one of the whitelisted IP addresses, they might be able to spoof that address to bypass Turnstile.'=>'每行一個 IP 位址，不支援萬用字元。透過允許的 IP 位址存取網站的使用者，不會需要進行 Turnstile 驗證。請注意，如果惡意第三方知道這個網站允許的 IP 位址，便可輕鬆避開 Turnstile 驗證。','IP Addresses'=>'IP 位址','When enabled, logged in users will not see the Turnstile challenge.'=>'啟用這項設定後，已登入的使用者不會再需要進行 Turnstile 驗證','Logged In Users'=>'登入的使用者','Whitelist Settings'=>'允許清單設定','Currently it is not possible to edit the actual "Failure!" message shown on the widget.'=>'目前無法編輯小工具發生驗證失敗時顯示的訊息。','This will show a message below the Turnstile widget if they receive the "Failure!" response. Useful to give instructions in the *very rare* case a valid user is being flagged as spam.'=>'如果使用者收到「驗證失敗」的回應，這個訊息便會顯示於 Turnstile 小工具下方。這對「有效的使用者遭到標記為濫用」這種非常罕見的狀況提供說明相當實用。','Failed to verify you are human. Please contact us if you are having issues.'=>'無法驗證你是真人。如果持續發生問題，請與我們聯絡。','HTML Markup Allowed.'=>'允許使用 HTML 標籤。','Extra Failure Message'=>'額外的驗證失敗訊息','Shown if the form is submitted without completing the Turnstile challenge. Leave blank to use the default message (localized):'=>'如果未完成 Turnstile 驗證便傳送表單，就會顯示這個訊息。欄位留空代表使用預設訊息 (如果支援的話，會以當地語系顯示):','Custom Error Message'=>'自訂錯誤訊息','When enabled, the javascript files loaded by the plugin will be deferred. You can disable this if it causes any issues with your other optimisations.'=>'啟用這項設定後，會延遲由這個外掛所載入的 JavaScript 檔案。如果這項設定會對這個網站的其他最佳化產生問題，網站管理員可以停用這項設定。','Defer Scripts'=>'延遲指令碼','These settings are for more advanced customisation. If you are not sure about these, they do not need to be changed.'=>'這些設定提供更進階的自訂項目。如果不清楚這些設定的意義，請不要進行任何變更。','Advanced Settings'=>'進階設定','When enabled, the user will not be able to click submit until the Turnstile challenge is completed.'=>'啟用這項設定後，使用者必須完成 Turnstile 驗證才能點擊 [提交] 按鈕','Disable Submit Button'=>'停用 [提交] 按鈕','Turnstile Widget is only displayed in cases where an interaction is required. This essentially makes it "invisible" for most valid users.'=>'Turnstile 小工具僅在需要進行互動時顯示。這對大多數的真人網站訪客來說，這個小工具為「不可見」的狀態。','Turnstile Widget is only displayed after the challenge begins.'=>'Turnstile 小工具僅在需要驗證時顯示。','Turnstile Widget is always displayed for all visitors.'=>'Turnstile 小工具會永遠向全部網站訪客顯示。','Interaction Only'=>'僅互動時顯示','Always'=>'永遠顯示','Appearance Mode'=>'顯示模式','Portuguese (Brazil)'=>'葡萄牙文 (巴西)','Auto Detect'=>'自動偵測','Language'=>'服務徽章語言','Auto'=>'自動切換','Dark'=>'深色','Light'=>'淺色','Theme'=>'外觀樣式','General Settings:'=>'一般設定','Secret Key'=>'秘密金鑰','Site Key'=>'網站金鑰','You can get your site key and secret key from here:'=>'請前往所列連結取得專屬網站金鑰及秘密金鑰:','Success! Turnstile is working correctly with your API keys.'=>'測試成功！Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能可以使用目前的 API 金鑰正確執行。','API Key Settings:'=>'API 金鑰設定','Please submit a review'=>'請撰寫使用者評論','Review on WordPress.org'=>'在 WordPress.org 上撰寫評等','Like this plugin?'=>'喜歡這個外掛嗎？','View setup guide'=>'查看設定指南','Learn more.'=>'進一步了解','Easily add the free CAPTCHA service called "Cloudflare Turnstile" to your WordPress forms to help prevent spam.'=>'輕鬆將免費的 Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能加入 WordPress，以避免各式功能表單遭到濫用。','TEST RESPONSE'=>'測試回應','Error message:'=>'錯誤訊息:','Failed! There is an error with your API settings. Please check & update them.'=>'測試失敗！API 設定發生錯誤。請檢查相關設定並做出正確變更。','Turnstile will not be added to any forms until the test is successfully complete.'=>'在測試成功前，外掛無法將 Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能加入至任何功能表單。','API keys have been updated. Please test the Turnstile API response below.'=>'API 金鑰已更新。請在下方測試 Turnstile API 的回應。','Almost done...'=>'即將完成...','https://www.relywp.com'=>'https://www.relywp.com','Elliot Sowersby, RelyWP'=>'Elliot Sowersby、RelyWP','Easily add Cloudflare Turnstile to your WordPress forms. The user-friendly, privacy-preserving CAPTCHA alternative.'=>'將 Cloudflare Turnstile 人機驗證功能加入 WordPress、WooCommerce、各式聯絡表單等的功能表單中，是方便使用、具備隱私保護、完全免費的 reCAPTCHA 替代解決方案。']];